- VideoAds.load: 首行短路，不再请求 messages.getSponsoredMessages(flags|=1)
- 与频道内广告同用 BuildVars.HIDE_SPONSORED 开关，可独立回滚

验证: ./gradlew :TMessagesProj_App:assembleDebug 退出码 0（BUILD SUCCESSFUL in 1m36s）
证据: docs/evidence/logs/build-S3c-20261102-093910.log
---
 .../src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/video/VideoAds.java  | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/video/VideoAds.java b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/video/VideoAds.java
index c9dce56d3..8df81f09b 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/video/VideoAds.java
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/org/telegram/messenger/video/VideoAds.java
@@ -196,6 +196,10 @@ public static VideoAds make(
     private void load() {
         if (loading || loaded) return;
 
+        if (BuildVars.HIDE_SPONSORED) {
+            return; // [patch G2] 关闭视频/图片查看器贴片广告，不发 messages.getSponsoredMessages
+        }
+
         if (UserConfig.getInstance(currentAccount).isPremium() && MessagesController.getInstance(currentAccount).isSponsoredDisabled()) {
             return;
         }
